  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil in a saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the pilaf rice and cook until lightly toasted, about 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add the Andean spices and stir to combine.",
    "Add 2 cups of water to the saucepan and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15-20 minutes or until the water is absorbed.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and stir in the crushed nougat.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro if desired.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
